              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ODani noJavani bahambahamba behamba bebuka izibuko zakho: insimbi ekhazimulayo, nekasiya nokugqwala kwakukhona emakethe yakho.",
